AI Gen Company Stack is original plugin and skill guidance authored for Dwain.

It references permissive open-source AI projects as integration targets and
architecture inspiration: Pydantic AI, LangGraph/LangChain, LlamaIndex,
smolagents, AnythingLLM, Flowise Community, LiteLLM, vLLM, Agent Skills
patterns, Ponytail-style minimal-code decision ladders, Caveman-style
terse communication patterns, Hallmark-style anti-generic UI design patterns,
Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills-style defensive security skill routing, and
system_prompts_leaks-style prompt-system pattern analysis.

No upstream source code from those projects is vendored into this plugin.
Review each upstream project's current license before copying or redistributing
their code in a downstream product.

Compliance boundary:

- Hallmark is referenced as MIT-licensed inspiration; this plugin contains an
  original UI design skill rather than copied Hallmark rules.
- Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills is referenced as Apache-2.0 inspiration; this
  plugin contains a defensive router skill rather than vendoring the full skill
  library.
- system_prompts_leaks is CC0, but leaked prompt contents may include third-party
  material. This plugin does not redistribute leaked prompts. It only uses the
  public collection as a signal for defensive prompt architecture patterns.
